  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>DME System for Fiber Recycling</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/HPFP-DME-System-for-Fiber-Recycling-a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Automated process allows control of full process from control room</li>\n<li>Contact materials all stainless steel</li>\n<li>Electrical meets Class 1 Div II hazardous location classification</li>\n<li>ASME code stamped vessels</li>\n<li>Full recycle of chemicals for minimal emissions</li>\n<li>Distillation units for recovering process fluids</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Liquified Gasses</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/supercritical-fluid-processing/liquefied-gases/butane-pilot-plant/\">Butane Pilot Plant</a></li><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/supercritical-fluid-processing/liquefied-gases/dme-system-for-fiber-recycling/\">DME System for Fiber Recycling</a></li><li><a href=\"/supercritical-fluid-processing/liquefied-gases/propane-system/\">Propane System</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/HPFP-DME-System-for-Fiber-Recycling-a-1024x646.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/HPFP-DME-System-for-Fiber-Recycling-a-300x189.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"189\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/HPFP-DME-System-for-Fiber-Recycling-b-1-1024x655.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/HPFP-DME-System-for-Fiber-Recycling-b-1-300x192.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"192\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>"
